        "description": "From measured day 0 through day 89, every newly released shipment of component 338929 receives 35 additional transport days. The paired C2 sensitivity retains 30 percent of measured-J0 on-hand stock and native standard in-transit pipeline on M-1810/338929; the DC-1920/268091 finished-product balance and pipeline remain at their simulated cutover values. Before warm-up, the DC-1920/268091 opening snapshot is scaled to 125 percent so the incident-free reference does not inherit a day-0 backlog unrelated to 338929. External or estimated-source pipelines are unchanged. This moderate demonstrator incident may be absorbed before reaching the client; a physically applied event with no customer backlog is retained as a valid resilience outcome. The delay propagates through M-1810, 268091, DC-1920 and the client when the paired state does not absorb it.",
